# Top-level FAT directory-entry order for sd/card.img (make-sd-image.sh copies in
# this order via mtools). The STOCK browser lists entries in this raw order; the
# MOD sorts them (directories first, then alphabetical) and hides junk. Keeping
# the directories interleaved here — Pokemon high, SAVER mid, Zelda low — makes
# the stock-vs-mod banner show the mod's sort at a glance. See docs/browser-sort.md.
#
# One top-level name per line ('#' comments, blanks ignored). Names not listed are
# appended in sorted order; ezgb.dat is added last automatically.
Pokemon
Kirby.gbc
Advance Game.gba
SAVER
Tetris.gb
.DS_Store
Wario Land.gb
Zelda
Pokemon.sav
._Kirby.gbc
readme.txt
EZGB.CFG
